    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24023" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενδρ-ήεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wooded,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος, ἄλσος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.200
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Mis.</u>
					352a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with tree-like markings,</i>
			
