					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					236
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενδρικός</span>
			, <i>of</i> or <i>for a tree,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.270
				</span></i>
			.</div>
